# Sovereign offline model mirror. Everything except the small tokenizer/
# config JSONs is kept out of git (the fp32 ONNX alone is 310MB, past
# GitHub 100MB file limit). Rebuild with scripts/export-kokoro-cache.py
# or by downloading onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX when network allows.
**
!.gitignore
!hf/
!hf/onnx-community/
!hf/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/
!hf/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/config.json
!hf/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/tokenizer.json
!hf/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX/tokenizer_config.json
